WEBVTT

00:04:28.036 --> 00:04:30.196
“Why aren’t you running?” asks the girl.

00:04:31.956 --> 00:04:36.476
“I’m studying the unraveling
of the world,” says the boy, earnestly.

00:04:37.756 --> 00:04:40.556
“That’s what this monster
represents in our dream.

00:04:41.356 --> 00:04:43.636
I’m an engineer and a knowledge-seeker.

00:04:43.956 --> 00:04:45.076
Pleased to meet you.”

00:04:47.076 --> 00:04:48.836
She turns away.

00:04:49.196 --> 00:04:51.396
There’s a storm inside her:

00:04:51.396 --> 00:04:54.196
grief and memory and anger.

00:04:54.876 --> 00:04:57.236
She takes a deep breath

00:04:57.236 --> 00:04:59.396
and walks toward the monster.

00:04:59.556 --> 00:05:01.076
She stands before it.